1
00:00:14,856 --> 00:00:16,096
You hit me so hard.

2
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,480
You really hate me that much, huh?

3
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,720
I just asked what you
two are to each other.

4
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,360
Oh,

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,040
so you like him, huh?

6
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,120
You can think whatever you want.

7
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,880
But if you cause Comrade Saeng any trouble,

8
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,120
I won't hold back like today.

9
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,240
Hmph.

10
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,800
Ouch! Ouch!

11
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,560
Whatever you want or dream of becoming,

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,760
I'll make sure none of it comes true.

13
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:39,800
"When Light Fades"
(Episode 7)

14
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:23,000
Lately, we've been taking care of
each other's wounds.

15
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,800
Comrade Fah knows about us, right?

16
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:48,880
As long as I'm here,
you don't have to be afraid, Vin.

17
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,560
I know.

18
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:55,279
But when Comrade Fah gets angry,

19
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,800
he's not someone easy to stop.

20
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,240
Look at Comrade Bai Tong.

21
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,600
No one even knows how she's doing now.

22
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,640
Comrade Bai Tong is with Comrade Ying now.

23
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,400
She's fine.

24
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,040
Why are you burning up like this?

25
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,480
Do you have a fever?

26
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,800
Comrade.

27
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,720
Have you seen Comrade Bai Tong?

28
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,280
Bai Tong!

29
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Bai Tong!

30
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:36,880
Bai Tong!

31
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:43,040
Bai Tong!

32
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,560
Bai Tong!

33
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,240
Bai Tong!

34
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,280
Bai Tong!

35
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,520
Bai Tong!

36
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,079
You two, move everything out.

37
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,600
Don't leave a single piece behind. Go!

38
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,600
Don't take my father's things!

39
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,200
- Hey!
- Don't!

40
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,680
- Bai Tong.
- Don't take my father's things!

41
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:23,600
Wearing makeup and fixing your hair like
this is against Party rules, understand?

42
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,200
Did you find her?
No, not at all.

43
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Bai Tong.

44
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,680
Bai Tong, it's me.

45
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,600
Bai Tong.

46
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,480
Bai Tong.

47
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,920
Bai Tong, it's me.

48
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,960
I'm here now.

49
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,080
I promise.

50
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,600
I won't let anyone hurt you again.

51
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,920
Let's go back to our base.

52
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,200
It's okay now.

53
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,160
Yaguar.

54
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,840
How is Comrade Bai Tong doing?

55
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,800
She cried so much she got a fever.

56
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,640
I just wiped her down.

57
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:55,760
Why is Comrade Ying crying?

58
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:09,263
Comrade Bai Tong keeps crying and
calling for Comrade Ploeng in her sleep.

59
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:12,040
She keeps crying and
apologizing to Comrade Fah.

60
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:18,080
How can a leader like this
make the country better?

61
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,320
I want to help Bai Tong
escape from the forest.

62
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,200
I don't want to stay here anymore.

63
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,760
Are you serious, Comrade Ying?

64
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,600
I don't want to stay here anymore.

65
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:44,760
If you really mean it,

66
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,680
I'll find a way to help.

67
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,160
Please help us, Yaguar.

68
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,840
Please don't cry, okay?

69
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,000
Sir.

70
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,400
Hey, sir.

71
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,160
Yaguar.

72
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,200
You called me here so suddenly.
Is something wrong?

73
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,080
Can you help take me somewhere else?

74
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,520
Are people suspicious of you?

75
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,840
No.

76
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,000
I just don't want to stay here anymore.

77
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,520
Three or four people
are coming with me too.

78
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,880
Can you help them too?

79
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,720
Did something happen in there?

80
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,360
Comrade Fah has been promoted to
leader of the base.

81
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,000
But he ended up hurting Pleong's daughter.

82
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,440
Tonight at 2AM,

83
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:25,200
I'll wait near the exit by
the old shooting range.

84
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,000
But you have to help
me with something first.

85
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:41,479
The other day, I went to drop off
the mail at Baan Kop Ku.

86
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:44,080
I heard someone from the main base
is coming to inspect our base.

87
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,679
If they're coming without prior notice,

88
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,320
it's probably not a normal inspection.

89
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:54,199
I think it's an order from the main
base to clean up the problems in our base.

90
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:57,840
Right. Our leader died
because of a traitor.

91
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:01,920
And the people in our base are mentally
falling apart because of Comrade Bai Tong.

92
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,599
If the inspection finds issues at our base,

93
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,839
they might even replace the leader.

94
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,680
What exactly are you
trying to say?

95
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,480
The biggest problem right now
is the traitor inside our base.

96
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,559
If we find out first,

97
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:18,639
We just report the main base
that it's been resolved.

98
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,640
We will.

99
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:20,800
We have to.

100
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,439
Alive or dead, I don't care anymore.

101
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,640
Comrade Fah.

102
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:30,960
Yaguar arranged for that Thai soldier
to help our people escape tonight.

103
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,480
I told you.

104
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,400
He is a traitor.

105
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,720
Damn it.

106
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,320
Vin.

107
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,680
Didn't you already take your medicine?

108
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,560
Why hasn't your fever gone down yet?

109
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:25,080
We're running low on medicine at the base,

110
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,200
So I only took one dose.

111
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:30,920
Maybe some rest will help.

112
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:34,320
How will you get better
on and off your meds?

113
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,400
I'll go get more medicine.

114
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:58,520
My son, my little sun.

115
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:21,760
(Meet me at Chan Siao Cave tonight. - Brother)

116
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,000
Vin.

117
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,160
Why do you look so pale?

118
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:31,080
Are you sick?

119
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:33,200
Why did you ask me to come?

120
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:35,080
I can't stay long.

121
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:42,800
From Aunt Laor.

122
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,000
She said she misses you much.

123
00:13:48,926 --> 00:13:51,326
Tell my mom I miss her too.

124
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,560
Very much.

125
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,320
I...

126
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,840
I... miss you too, Vin.

127
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:13,120
Ever since I moved away
and went to military prep school,

128
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:17,040
I finally realized that I
never saw you as just...

129
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:21,920
a younger brother.

130
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,560
You mean more to me than that.

131
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,680
But I only see you as my older brother.

132
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,599
Yeah. I guess I rushed things.

133
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,280
Saying something like this out of nowhere.

134
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:20,400
Well,

135
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:22,160
Forget what I said for now.

136
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:25,480
Just think about whether you
want to go home and see Aunt Laor.

137
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,080
That's enough.

138
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,280
If you want to,

139
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:30,880
I know a way.

140
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,520
Didn't I tell you already?

141
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,279
Don't ever come back here again.

142
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,280
And what if I do come back?

143
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:57,640
Vin.

144
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,863
Soon the government will allow people
to leave the forest without prosecution.

145
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,639
I've been ordered to prepare a
reception point at the military camp.

146
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,679
If you want to go home and see Aunt Laor,

147
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,879
you can come anytime.

148
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,239
Vin's not going anywhere with you.

149
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,840
How do you know he won't?

150
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,200
I heard that the base is a mess too.

151
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,439
The government wants to help those
who fled to the forest.

152
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:22,000
Why don't you take this chance?

153
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,880
Or are you going to wait
until Vin dies here too?

154
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:22,400
Your stomach acting up
again, Comrade Gaun Hin?

155
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,240
Yeah.

156
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:31,000
Do you have any medicine left?

157
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:35,919
Comrade, Once you're done
packing, go get some rest.

158
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,559
I'll take care here.

159
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,840
Okay.

160
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:46,120
What is it?

161
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,920
Why did you ask to meet now?

162
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,079
Do you know where Comrade Saeng went?

163
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,800
We've looked everywhere and can't find him.

164
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:53,760
Umm...

165
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:55,640
I haven't seen him since after dinner.

166
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:58,120
Maybe he went on a mission.

167
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:06,080
I found a way out of here.

168
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,960
I'll take Comrade Bai Tong out of here.

169
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:11,440
Come with us, please.

170
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:13,520
Why do you want to escape?

171
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,880
Have you forgotten what we stood for?

172
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:29,120
Before we entered the forest,

173
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:32,360
we gave up everything.

174
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:37,240
Because we believed that this was
the only way to make the country better.

175
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,960
But ever since Comrade
Fah became the leader,

176
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:42,079
we can't even live here in peace.

177
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:43,279
Can't you see, Comrade?

178
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:45,360
How is the country supposed
to get better like this?

179
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:48,440
I agree with you on Comrade Fah.

180
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:51,440
But about escaping...

181
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:55,400
Even if we find Comrade Saeng,
he won't go with us.

182
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:04,720
Have you really thought this through?

183
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,600
Yes, I have.

184
00:20:18,560 --> 00:20:19,560
Then...

185
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:23,480
good luck.

186
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,000
I hope one day we'll meet again outside.

187
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:58,719
We'll use the supply route to leave.

188
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:00,319
There won't be any guards tonight.

189
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:01,600
Don't worry.

190
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:04,440
What about Comrade Saeng?

191
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:09,560
Only three of us are going.

192
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:13,200
Will we ever see Comrade Saeng again?

193
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:16,880
Of course.

194
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:19,039
We definitely will.

195
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:20,120
It's only a matter of time.

196
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:22,040
Come on. We should get moving.

197
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:37,720
I'm sorry.

198
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:39,239
I went to see him.

199
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,520
You did it knowing it was wrong.

200
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:42,440
Do you know how risky it was?

201
00:21:43,120 --> 00:21:45,360
What did you think
when that soldier asked you to leave?

202
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,360
Our base is not a good place anymore.

203
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,760
The government has toned down.

204
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:51,240
So I hesitated.

205
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:52,840
What about me?

206
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,320
Sin.

207
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,360
Do you want to leave with me?

208
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,080
I can't leave.

209
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:13,280
I have to stay here and take care everyone.

210
00:22:14,840 --> 00:22:16,240
They helped me when I escaped.

211
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:20,519
If you want me to leave everyone here,

212
00:22:20,520 --> 00:22:21,520
I can't do that.

213
00:22:22,840 --> 00:22:24,360
This place already feels like my home.

214
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,440
Sin.

215
00:22:31,760 --> 00:22:32,920
I mean...

216
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Deep within your heart,

217
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,680
do you want to leave with me?

218
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,520
There's something...

219
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,000
I want you to know.

220
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:02,159
Feels like someone's following us.

221
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,160
Go. Hurry.

222
00:23:12,560 --> 00:23:13,840
Comrade Yue.

223
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:16,239
What are you doing here?

224
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,520
Why didn't you intercept Yaguar?

225
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:19,559
Where has Comrade Saeng been?

226
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:21,000
He came with me.

227
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:36,862
Comrade Yue loves Comrade Saeng.

228
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:39,280
Isn't that right?

229
00:23:40,360 --> 00:23:41,360
Yes.

230
00:23:48,040 --> 00:23:49,800
But Comrade Saeng is a man.

231
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:52,400
Whether he's man or woman,

232
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:54,960
it doesn't matter to me.

233
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,440
Hurry!

234
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,440
Hurry! Run!

235
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:18,800
Bai Tong!

236
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,000
Bai Tong!

237
00:24:24,320 --> 00:24:25,320
Are you okay?

238
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:26,920
Climb on my back.

239
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:40,040
Hey!

240
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:44,360
Bai Tong.

241
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:05,520
Comrade, didn't we agree to
send them to the main base?

242
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,320
I'll lure them over there.

243
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:33,680
Comrade!

244
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:35,720
I said stop shooting.

245
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,359
If we kill them now,

246
00:25:37,360 --> 00:25:39,160
how will we know where
the others are hiding?

247
00:25:48,320 --> 00:25:50,399
Shit! You talk too much!

248
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:52,360
You really butt into my business.

249
00:25:57,520 --> 00:25:58,920
Bai Tong. Bai Tong.

250
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:00,880
Bai Tong.

251
00:26:33,800 --> 00:26:35,679
Stop crying,

252
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:37,160
get up.

253
00:26:44,360 --> 00:26:45,440
So beautiful.

254
00:26:46,520 --> 00:26:49,880
Of course. Because I made it for you.

255
00:26:50,840 --> 00:26:53,160
Comrade Ploeng hasn't gone anywhere far.

256
00:26:53,817 --> 00:26:55,456
He's just change where he lives.

257
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:58,120
Now he's living in
Comrade Bai Tong's heart.

258
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,560
And you still have us.

259
00:27:01,120 --> 00:27:04,200
Comrade Saeng, and all comrades
are still by your side.

260
00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:29,760
- Bai Tong.
- Comrade Ying.

261
00:27:30,360 --> 00:27:32,040
Go. Run. Go!

262
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:38,160
Bai Tong.

263
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:45,160
Bai Tong.

264
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:49,160
Bai Tong.

265
00:27:52,080 --> 00:27:53,559
What the hell are you doing?

266
00:27:53,560 --> 00:27:54,800
Get out!

267
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:59,080
Why are you doing this?

268
00:28:01,713 --> 00:28:05,153
Bai Tong. I'm so sorry Bai Tong.

269
00:28:05,560 --> 00:28:06,560
Comrade Bai Tong.

270
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:08,600
Comrade Bai Tong.

271
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,400
Comrade Bai Tong.

272
00:28:11,120 --> 00:28:12,200
Comrade Bai Tong.

273
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:15,400
Comrade Bai Tong.

274
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:19,400
Sin, listen to me first.

275
